OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for massive solar farm enter
OL,4,Anext stage
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe next stage of the planning process
OL,7,Ffor what could be one of the UK's
OL,8,Fbiggest solar farms has begun.
OL,10,FMore than 5,000 people have objected to
OL,11,FIsland Green Power plans to build a
OL,12,F500-megawatt solar farm across 3,000
OL,13,Facres in North Wiltshire and now the
OL,14,Ffinal set of public hearings have
OL,15,Fstarted as part of a six month
OL,16,Fexamination period.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
