OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for massive solar farm enter
OL,4,Anext stage
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnna-Kate Fuller, founder of the
OL,7,Fcampaign group Stop Lime Down, said:
OL,8,F"We have worked tirelessly to raise
OL,9,Ffunds from across our community to
OL,10,Fprotect and preserve this part of the
OL,11,Fcountryside."
OL,13,FWill Threlfall, Senior Project
OL,14,FDevelopment Manager responded: "We will
OL,15,Fcontinue to listen carefully and
OL,16,Frespond to the points raised throughout
OL,17,Fthe process".
